MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Hur_Arena_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Hur_Arena_m01_001: Your match is on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}. Please show up on\nthe appointed date.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c04_Hur_Arena_m01: <BLN>Your next match...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Bon_m01_001: Whenever I have free time, I make a point of seeing\nas much of the city as I can.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Bon_m01_002: It is as breathtaking as one would expect from a city\nthat has stood for over a thousand years.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Bon_m01_003: Everywhere are signs of being designed for\nfunctionality, not merely for luxury.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Bon_m01_004: I must carefully observe even the smallest details\nand commit them to the storehouse of my mind.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Bon_m01_005: I suspect there are lessons here we can apply to our\nown kingdom when building new cities.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c04_Bon_m01: <BLN>Very interesting.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Tob_m01_001: Might just be because of the Heroic Games, but it\nalways feels like a party in Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Tob_m01_002: Guys and gals, young and old, all kinds of folks\nhaving a great time together.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Tob_m01_003: It ain't like this in Megaira, that's for sure. Not unless\nit's a real special occasion.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Tob_m01_004: Actually, the last time the place was buzzing like this\nwas at your coronation, boss.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c04_Tob_m01: <BLN>Love the mood here!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Lil_m01_001: People sure hate Yu Phas outside of Saramis.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Lil_m01_002: I don't get it. Everyone dies in the end, so what's the\nproblem with her?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Lil_m01_003: Whatever it is, I guess we're the weird ones here.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c04_Lil_m01: <BLN>So weird.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Lys_m01_001: Broadly speaking, this city is split into several tiers.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Lys_m01_002: I suppose the temples' influence gets stronger as you\nascend to the higher tiers.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_Lys_m01_003: On the other hand, the lower you go, the denser\nthe population seems to be.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c04_Lys_m01: <BLN>I took a look around.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_B01_m01_001: Greetings. Our flagship, the Trafalgar, is undergoing\nmaintenance.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_B01_m01_002: The hull scraped the riverbed of the Sobek River as\nwe sailed it, so we're worried about leaks.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c04_B01_m01_003: We can set sail again once the repairs are complete.\nUntil then, I'm sorry, but you'll have to wait.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c04_B01_m01: <BLN>A report!